This is a training app. The study GLV-12-301, the drug GLV-12, its sponsor, the sites, the
participants and all data are fictional. Any resemblance to real studies, products,
organisations or people is coincidental. The app is not a validated system and must not hold
real patient data. Everything runs in the browser; nothing is sent to a server.

CDISC ADaM, ADaMIG, SDTM, Dataset-JSON and the Analysis Results Standard are standards
published by CDISC (cdisc.org). Names, dataset and variable names are used as CDISC publishes
them, for education. MedDRA terms in the data are fictional look-alikes.

